# Every file here decides what ends up inside a signed RPM on someone else's
# machine, and several of them decide what runs as root when it is installed.
# There is no path in this repository that does not want an owner's eyes on it.
*                       @mineiro

# Called out separately because these are the ones where a change is easy to
# wave through and expensive to get wrong: the builder COPR executes, the
# recorded checksums that decide whether a download is accepted, the checks that
# gate a merge, and the rules that decide who may bypass them.
/.copr/                 @mineiro
/scripts/               @mineiro
/.github/               @mineiro
/packages/*/*.spec      @mineiro
/packages/*/sources.sha256  @mineiro
